&lt;div&gt;
	The staff have been trained/re-trained/given instructions/are under revised supervisory arrangements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	A new management system has been implemented.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
