&lt;div&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	Management has reviewed the procedures and introduced regular checks. Refrigeration temperatures are now recorded twice daily, food safety and cleaning records are maintained, staff training evidence is kept at the premises, and staff have been given further instruction on food hygiene and the safe cooking and cooling of rice.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	Management will regularly review and sign the records to ensure these improvements are maintained.&lt;/div&gt;
